CORE
test.c
--nondet-volatile-write-model reg:observe --mmio-weak --mmio-weak-depth 2
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
MMIO write burst exceeds the modelled reorder depth
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
Three consecutive writes to reg with no barrier form a burst longer than the
depth-2 reorder buffer. Rather than silently under-approximating the reordering,
the model reports the burst and tells the user to raise --mmio-weak-depth.
Compare ok.desc, which uses a deep enough buffer.
